  // ── Spintax: ✨ Spin button + live variant helper + preview ──────────────
  // Spin wraps interchangeable words as {a|b|c} so each recipient gets a slightly
  // different message (deliverability). The server resolves it at send; this UI
  // shows the variant count, validates braces, and previews a random sample.
