  // ---------- Number-health protections: enable + cross-promote ----------
  // Two protections: smart routing (reroute among your own numbers — no cost,
  // no attestation) and SMS auto-swap (auto-buy a fresh number when one is
  // flagged — costs a number fee, needs an authorization). Turning on EITHER
  // offers the other via a light pitch, but ONLY if the other is still off (so
  // there's no ping-pong). Crucially the pitch is checkbox-FREE: enabling the
  // free feature must never throw the paid attestation at you up front — the
  // authorization is only collected if/when you click through to enable it.
